  "claim_ceiling": "P028 v1 is a representation and governance contract only. It can serialize previously governed propositions and expose accepted Stage10/11 development projections to a non-production development-shadow expert view. It does not calculate new stage truth from market data, qualify any historical code, publish a primary stage, activate a LabelCard, open a holdout, or grant production expert, strategy or trading authority."
